{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POWER-UP</strong> is a fast-paced retro-style shoot-'em-up from one-man studio <strong>Psychotic Psoftware</strong>, blending classic arcade action with a tactical weapon progression system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by legendary SHMUPs like <strong>R-Type</strong>, <strong>Hellfire</strong>, and <strong>Project-X</strong>, Power-Up delivers intense side-scrolling battles, massive bosses and a devastating arsenal of evolving weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot the experimental fighter <strong>Weapon-F</strong> through the wreckage of humanity\u2019s last escape attempt and strike back against the reptilian invaders who destroyed Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last human alive.<br>Your mission is simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revenge.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Classic <strong>side-scrolling arcade shoot-'em-up gameplay</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>Weapon evolution system</strong> \u2013 upgrade and transform your arsenal mid-battle<br>\u2022 Huge <strong>screen-filling bosses</strong> and challenging enemy formations<br>\u2022 Multiple weapons and tactical loadouts<br>\u2022 Vibrant retro-inspired visuals<br>\u2022 A powerful <strong>original soundtrack</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Earth has fallen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the pilot of the prototype fighter <strong>Weapon-F</strong>, you emerge from the shattered debris of humanity\u2019s final escape shuttle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reptilian war fleet that wiped out mankind still occupies the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Against impossible odds, you launch one final counter-attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the war isn\u2019t over.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/312640?t=1773257688","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/312640?t=1773257688","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/312640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773257688","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/312640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773257688","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POWER-UP</strong> is a fast-paced retro-style shoot-'em-up from one-man studio <strong>Psychotic Psoftware</strong>, blending classic arcade action with a tactical weapon progression system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by legendary SHMUPs like <strong>R-Type</strong>, <strong>Hellfire</strong>, and <strong>Project-X</strong>, Power-Up delivers intense side-scrolling battles, massive bosses and a devastating arsenal of evolving weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot the experimental fighter <strong>Weapon-F</strong> through the wreckage of humanity\u2019s last escape attempt and strike back against the reptilian invaders who destroyed Earth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last human alive.<br>Your mission is simple.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Revenge.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Classic <strong>side-scrolling arcade shoot-'em-up gameplay</strong><br>\u2022 <strong>Weapon evolution system</strong> \u2013 upgrade and transform your arsenal mid-battle<br>\u2022 Huge <strong>screen-filling bosses</strong> and challenging enemy formations<br>\u2022 Multiple weapons and tactical loadouts<br>\u2022 Vibrant retro-inspired visuals<br>\u2022 A powerful <strong>original soundtrack</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Earth has fallen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the pilot of the prototype fighter <strong>Weapon-F</strong>, you emerge from the shattered debris of humanity\u2019s final escape shuttle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The reptilian war fleet that wiped out mankind still occupies the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Against impossible odds, you launch one final counter-attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity is gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the war isn\u2019t over.</p>","developers":["Psychotic Psoftware"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/312640/header.jpg?t=1773257688","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92013 Psychotic Psoftware.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/312640/24424/48c91e5749248062870220e3c342990cd330f543/1751263325/dash_av1.mpd?t=1447363358","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/312640/24424/48c91e5749248062870220e3c342990cd330f543/1751263325/dash_h264.mpd?t=1447363358","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/312640/24424/48c91e5749248062870220e3c342990cd330f543/1751263325/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1447363358","id":2034111,"name":"Power-Up - Steam Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2034111/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1447363358"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/312640/22713/856c10343ee0f02b31982aad5aae2a0794cd75b8/1751263324/dash_av1.mpd?t=1447362588","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/312640/22713/856c10343ee0f02b31982aad5aae2a0794cd75b8/1751263324/dash_h264.mpd?t=1447362588","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/312640/22713/856c10343ee0f02b31982aad